{
  "$comment": "The Niyoos wire values the n8n node (n8n-nodes-niyoos, its own public repository) depends on. Source of truth is the backend; backend/test/unit/n8n-node-contract.test.ts fails when this file and the backend disagree. The node repository carries a byte-identical copy at contract/niyoos-contract.json. Change both together.",
